::'''Cyrene:''' And it will be a glance that spans time and space, transforming each incarnation of me into the power you shall wield to reset time &mdash; imbuing my soul into this ceremonial blade, and creating an {{Rubi|{{Цвет|Ключевой|nobold=1|endless Flame-Chase Journey}}|{{Цвет|Ключевой|nobold=1|unending Era Nova}}}}.
