----
:'''Ripples of Past Reverie:''' Someone once told the very first "me" that everything was false, that the only life in Amphoreus was a great catastrophe nurtured using the world as a factor.
:'''Ripples of Past Reverie:''' But how could a dream feel so real? That's why I didn't agree with him.
:'''Ripples of Past Reverie:''' My good friend, I'll read this book to you... for {{Цвет|Ключевой|nobold=1|the 33,550,335th time}}.
:'''Ripples of Past Reverie:''' That way, it won't just be "Cyrene's" memories alone.
:'''Scepter δ-me13:''' {{Цвет|Огненный|>>> Formatting progress: 23.815%...}}
:'''Scepter δ-me13:''' {{Цвет|Огненный|>>> Process error: Analyzing...}}
:'''Ripples of Past Reverie:''' It doesn't even make me feel cold anymore. It's like a ceremonial conclusion, ending every cycle's "narration" with a full stop.
:'''Ripples of Past Reverie:''' Then, there will be a new "me" returning here with new "memories."
:'''Ripples of Past Reverie:''' Before I knew it, this palace we built together was no longer a dream that "Cyrene" alone indulged in.
:'''Ripples of Past Reverie:''' It's now a saga composed by you, me, and all the Flame-Chasers. It's our weak but endless prayer for "tomorrow."
:'''Ripples of Past Reverie:''' There will come a day when someone turns over this nearly "eternal" page...
:'''Ripples of Past Reverie:''' And awakens all the dust-covered "memories," so they can be recalled by the world in a more beautiful form.
:'''Scepter δ-me13:''' {{Цвет|Огненный|>>> Process error: Analyz███ ███}}
:'''Ripples of Past Reverie:''' I'll read, and you'll listen, like how flowers always bloom then wither.
:'''Ripples of Past Reverie:''' I shall welcome my own decay, becoming nourishment for the next flower's bud.
:'''Ripples of Past Reverie:''' And you shall continue to wait here, protecting this garden of "memories."
:'''Ripples of Past Reverie:''' That way, when the "Deliverer" arrives, the first thing they'll see is an endless sea of flowers.
:'''Ripples of Past Reverie:''' And our stories will be lying silently among the flowers like every ripple of "remembrance"...
:'''Ripples of Past Reverie:''' {{Цвет|Ключевой|nobold=1|And they shall become the epic known as ''As I've Written''.}}
:'''Dan Heng:''' The texture of memories is preserved in countless pillars...
:'''Dan Heng:''' She gave everything to record all the forgotten recurrences across thirty million cycles.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} This great tomb is the seed of Remembrance...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} We will put an end to this endless waiting.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Let's march into the new world with all the past.
:'''Ripples of Past Reverie:''' Alright, alright, let's not make things so gloomy.
:{{tx}}
{{Dialogue End}}

