:'''"Evernight":''' "Those who are lost remain lost, while those who have met will meet again."
:'''"Evernight":''' What a touching scene. The deepest place in this world is exactly the ideal location for the Trailblaze to reunite.
:'''Dan Heng:''' You're not the one we want to reunite with, "Evernight."
:'''Dan Heng:''' But you'd better explain everything to us: this tomb, and the "Thirteenth Titan"...
:'''Dan Heng:''' ...Tell us everything you know.
:'''"Evernight":''' You're too on edge, Dan Heng. I've always been honest with the two of you.
:'''"Evernight":''' Before we talk about Amphoreus's destiny, why don't we lay aside our differences...
:'''"Evernight":''' And take a moment together to mourn for the cruel "truth"?
:'''Dan Heng:''' "Truth"...?
:'''"Evernight":''' So you still haven't figured it out.
:'''"Evernight":''' Take another moment to look around. Look closely. You must be curious as to where the final Titan is located, right?
:'''"Evernight":''' What a good question that is. I, too, am curious...
:'''"Evernight":''' {{Цвет|Ключевой|nobold=1|Because there is absolutely nothing here, except a cold, empty void!}}
:'''Black Swan:''' You mean... Cyrene was deceived.
:'''"Evernight":''' Indeed. Fuli planted a false hope in her heart, making her believe that she was special and that Amphoreus still had a chance.
:'''"Evernight":''' Then, that poor girl walked into the great tomb over and over again and willingly offered herself to the Remembrance.
:'''Black Swan:''' Why did THEY do that?
:'''"Evernight":''' Did you really think THEY would just save this crumbling world in the way Cyrene was praying for?
:'''"Evernight":''' Don't be naive, Memokeeper. In this game between Gods...
:'''"Evernight":''' {{Цвет|Ключевой|nobold=1|The Remembrance chose to stand with the Destruction.}}
:'''Black Swan:''' Given your evident hostility towards the Garden, I find it hard to take anything you say at face value.
:'''"Evernight":''' Aren't the Memosnatchers' activities enough evidence? They did everything they could to help Irontomb reach completion, and it wasn't just to obtain some fanciful memories. Let me tell you the real reason...
:'''"Evernight":''' {{Цвет|Ключевой|nobold=1|Irontomb is a perfect ark}}. If a seed can be planted within, then the moment the Lord Ravager blows the Erudition to pieces, the Remembrance will be spread to every corner of the cosmos.
:'''"Evernight":''' That masterless Path will be equally split between two Aeons. Fuli... will devour the Erudition.
:'''Black Swan:''' ...
:'''"Evernight":''' Do you understand now? The war among Aeons started long ago.
:'''"Evernight":''' Fuli did not glance this way to save Amphoreus. THEY will drain this world dry and turn it into a most poignant and tragic poem.
:'''"Evernight":''' But fortunately, that girl's sacrifices won't be wasted. I will give her another possibility.
:'''"Evernight":''' I promised (Trailblazer) that I would re-create the cause and effect of this world, and form a flawless Amphoreus.
:'''"Evernight":''' But the only way for a world that can't be turned back to be considered "flawless"...
:'''"Evernight":''' {{Цвет|Ключевой|nobold=1|Is to burn it with a raging fire until nothing remains.}}
:'''Black Swan:''' You plan to... destroy all the "memories" Cyrene has ever recorded?
:'''"Evernight":''' That's right. I'll set fire to all the stories, all the emotions, all the futility... I'll turn the Garden's conspiracy to dust.
:'''"Evernight":''' Setting fire to this much material will be enough to completely annihilate the Scepter's operating logic. Irontomb will lose the soil upon which it grows, and Amphoreus... will be truly set free.
:'''Black Swan:''' The "freedom" you speak of is no different from Destruction. Everything this world ever was will disappear from the extrapolations, never to be regained.
:'''Black Swan:''' That would also include your "memories," by the way.
:'''"Evernight":''' That's right. That's why I needed your help, little bird. The more we walked together, the more I was convinced...
:'''"Evernight":''' ...That you have a beautiful dharmakāya. It fits me very much.
:'''Black Swan:''' So that's why you took me here...
:'''Black Swan:''' {{Цвет|Ключевой|nobold=1|Your true form... is a bottomless obsession.}}
:'''"Evernight":''' Smart girl. You haven't disappointed me.
:'''"Evernight":''' This avatar is but a shadow cast by the candlelight. Discarding it invokes no feelings within me. What I must preserve is only my "wish"...
:'''"Evernight":''' {{Цвет|Ключевой|nobold=1|My wish to kill the Path of Remembrance.}}
:'''"Evernight":''' "March 7th" will not find peace as long as THEY and THEIR fanatical henchmen exist.
:'''"Evernight":''' The road ahead is still long, and she needs a guardian to stand by her side. You... are my best choice.
:'''Black Swan:''' Allow me to refuse. That duty seems far too heavy.
:'''"Evernight":''' Resistance is pointless, my darling birdie. I will personally plant myself into your heart. And once I've calmed down (Trailblazer) and Dan Heng...
:'''"Evernight":''' I will head into reality and find the "true you."
:'''Black Swan:''' So... That wasn't enough to fool you.
:'''"Evernight":''' A genius's mirror trick and a protective mechanism of the Erudition. Is that right?
:'''"Evernight":''' Those layers of security do make things a little difficult.
:'''Black Swan:''' But unfortunately, those two Nameless are already right outside the door. Your plan... is about to encounter a few mishaps.
:'''Black Swan:''' Until we meet again, Miss "Evernight."
:'''"Evernight":''' Will you still not stand with me, my companions? We'll save the beautiful cosmos, and we won't leave even a single scar behind.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} We are confident that we can defeat Irontomb.
::'''"Evernight":''' Perhaps you can. But what will that cost?
::Amphoreus should not be discarded.
::I'll never agree to your means!
::I'm not your companion! Give March 7th back to us!
